<view class="container"><view class="eyebrow">MARKET</view><view class="title">搜索与自选</view><view class="subtitle">自选与持仓分开保存；删除自选不会修改交易记录。</view>
<view class="card"><input value="{{query}}" bindinput="onQuery" maxlength="80" placeholder="输入至少 2 个字符"/><view wx:if="{{searching}}" class="muted">搜索中…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
<view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="instrument_key" class="row"><view bindtap="open" data-key="{{item.instrument_key}}"><view class="symbol">{{item.symbol}} <text class="badge">{{item.asset_type}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.name}} · {{item.exchange}}</view></view><button size="mini" class="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="add">加自选</button></view></view>
<view class="section">我的自选</view><view wx:if="{{!watchlist.length}}" class="card empty muted">暂无自选，不会自动加入示例标的。</view><view wx:for="{{watchlist}}" wx:key="instrument_key" class="card row"><view bindtap="open" data-key="{{item.instrument_key}}"><view class="symbol">{{item.symbol}} <text class="badge">{{item.asset_type}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.name}}</view></view><button size="mini" class="secondary" data-key="{{item.instrument_key}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view>
